# Two-page restaurant menu in a tall format (420 × 700). A cream background and a double frame
# drawn with Page overlay elements with a negative Layer, which stay behind the content on all the
# pages; dishes with description and price in a Stack, and a box for the tasting menu,
# with the price and the closing note in bold inside the line (Markup: markdown). The section
# labels are written in lowercase and put in uppercase, spaced out, with Case and Letter spacing.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Width: 420
		Height: 700
		Margin: 50 54 52 54
	Title: Menu · Restaurante La Cala
	Language: en
	Section:
		Page overlay:
			Id: paper
			Offset: -50 -54 -52 -54
			Layer: -2
			Box:
				Background: #FBF6EA
		Page overlay:
			Id: frame-outer
			Offset: -30 -34 -32 -34
			Layer: -1
			Box:
				Corner radius: 10
				Border: 1.2
				Border color: #14365C
		Page overlay:
			Id: frame-inner
			Offset: -24 -28 -26 -28
			Layer: -1
			Box:
				Corner radius: 4
				Border: 0.5
				Border color: #926829
		Page overlay:
